ICCV-2025-P0228,ICCV-2025-A001325,Haoyu Zhen,shared,3,7,7,"Harvard University Unseen scene, unseen object Input Instruction: Pick up the brown cup – Franka Panda Robot RGB-DN Video Generation Put shoes in box – Franka Panda Robot 4D Scene Reconstruction & Explicit Actions In Domain: RLBench (Sim) Point Cloud Reach the target Lift RGB . Open Box Input Image Depth . Put Shoes Mesh Normal Cross Domain Input Instruction: Pick up the apple from white bowl – Trossen WidowX RGB-DN Video Generation 4D Scene Reconstruction & Explicit Actions Move coke can near bottle - Google Robot In Domain: Fractal Data (Real) Point Cloud RGB Grasp Depth Normal Point Cloud Input Image Figure . We propose TesserAct, the 4D Embodied World Model, which takes an input image and text instruction to generate RGB, depth, and normal videos, reconstructing a 4D scene and predicting actions. Our model not only achieves strong performance on in-domain data (right) but also generalizes effectively to unseen scenes, novel objects (top left), and cross-domain scenarios (bottom left).",0,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P0228.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Zhen_Learning_4D_Embodied_World_Models_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
