ICCV-2025-P0565,ICCV-2025-A003286,Shunsuke Yasuki,shared,3,8,8,"The University of Tokyo ATR Institute of Science Tokyo National Institute of Informatics Project Page: Figure . Overview of the proposed compositional geographic reasoning task. This task enables natural language interaction with city-scale 3D scenes, supporting diverse geographic reasoning scenarios. Given a natural language query, our GeoProg3D decomposes the task into modular steps, executes structured visual programs using geographic APIs, and integrates results for interpretable and accurate reasoning.",-7,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P0565.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Yasuki_GeoProg3D_Compositional_Visual_Reasoning_for_City-Scale_3D_Language_Fields_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
