ICCV-2025-P0595,ICCV-2025-A003438,Erik Daxberger,shared,3,11,11,"Apple Figure . (Left) We generate the Cubify Anything VQA (CA-VQA) dataset and benchmark, covering various ) input signals: single image, metric depth (sensor-based and estimated), multi-frame/-view, and ) spatial understanding tasks: e.g., relationship prediction, metric estimation, 3D grounding. (Right) We train MM-Spatial, a generalist multimodal LLM that excels at 3D spatial understanding. It supports Chain-of-Thought spatial reasoning involving 2D grounding and depth estimation, and can also leverage depth input via tool-use.",-4,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P0595.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Daxberger_MM-Spatial_Exploring_3D_Spatial_Understanding_in_Multimodal_LLMs_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
