ICCV-2025-P1002,ICCV-2025-A005859,Yatai Ji,shared,3,12,12,"User Prompt The University of Hong Kong Image Prompt Optimization System Optimized Prompt Image-centric Prompt Optimization User Prompt ByteDance ExpertCollected Modifiers Optimized Prompt Shanghai AI Lab User Prompt Optimized Prompt LLM LLM In-context Learning High-quality Modifier Template Video Diffusion Model Current Prompt Adaption Framework: Modality-Inconsistency, Cost-Discrepancy and Model-Unaware P User Prompt GPT refine Automatic Rewarding Video Diffusion Model Image-level Video-level P1 SFT Data Pool SFT Model … Pn SFT Reward Model Matrixes Video Diffusion Model Image-level Video-level DPO Rank Data Pool Reward Model Matrixes DPO LLM-driven Video Prompt Optimization System Reward-guided Model Preference Alignment Reward-guided Prompt Evolution Our Prompt-A-Video: Video-Centric, Labor-Free and Preference-Aligned Figure . Illustration of the discrepancies between current prompt adaption frameworks and our proposed LLM-driven video prompt optimization system, namely Prompt-A-Video. Current prompt adaption frameworks predominantly focus on prompt systems tailored for images, collecting intrinsic modifier templates, or rely on the in-context capabilities of LLM. However, in the realm of text-to-video, these methods encounter challenges stemming from Modality-Inconsistency, Cost-Discrepancy, and Model-Unaware. In this paper, we introduce Prompt-A-Video, a two-stage optimization and alignment system based on AI feedback, which aims to provide Video-Centric, Labor-Free and Preference-Aligned prompts.",0,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P1002.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Ji_Prompt-A-Video_Prompt_Your_Video_Diffusion_Model_via_Preference-Aligned_LLM_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
