n, super-resolution, and outpainting. Our code and dataset are publicly available at:",-12,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P1162.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Bai_ReCamMaster_Camera-Controlled_Generative_Rendering_from_A_Single_Video_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
