ICCV-2025-P1528,ICCV-2025-A009022,Yufei Wang,shared,3,7,7,"Snap Research Nanyang Technological University UT Austin （a） Original “with laptop” “laptop -> apple” （b） Original （c） Original “with glasses” “silver sculpture” （d） Original （e） Original “horse” -> “camel” “horse” -> “zebra” （f） Original “face-to-face” “with hats” “ground” -> “cloud” “sitting” -> “standing” “3D Disney cartoon style” + “laughing” Figure . AREdit for Text-Guided Image Editing. It can effectively handle a variety of editing tasks for both artificial and natural images, e.g., object removal (as in examples a), object addition (b, c), attribute modification (b, d), and style alteration (c, f). Our method excels at preserving unrelated areas of the image while offering a flexible trade-off with generative capacity. Remarkably fast, our approach processes a 1080p input image in . seconds for the first run and ∼ . second for subsequent runs on an A100 GPU.",-2,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P1528.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Wang_Training-Free_Text-Guided_Image_Editing_with_Visual_Autoregressive_Model_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
