ICCV-2025-P1603,ICCV-2025-A009455,Marcos V. Conde,shared,3,3,3,"Computer Vision Lab, CAIDAS & IFI, University of Würzburg, Germany ISP sRGB This image is too dark, please increase the exposure. The enitre image looks flat, I want an image with higher contrast. The image looks too dark and cold, make it a bit warmer and brighter. Can you make my photo look like in winter? Figure . Given an image and text prompts for how to edit the image, our multi-task image processing model edits the image considering the human instructions. PixTalk, covers over transformations that can be commonly found in photography software (e.g. Adobe Lightroom), and it generalizes of-the-shelf on real-world photographs from diverse cameras and sensors.",2,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P1603.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Conde_PixTalk_Controlling_Photorealistic_Image_Processing_and_Editing_with_Language_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
