ICCV-2025-P1633,ICCV-2025-A009626,Aniruddha Mahapatra,shared,3,5,5,"Northeastern University Reconstruction Ground-Truth MagViTv2- × Text-to-Video Prompt: a capybara made of pixelated voxels is seated … ProMAG- × Prompt: An astronaut in a pressure suit is floating weightlessly … Figure . (left) Our video tokenizer ProMAG is capable of much more effectively reconstructing high motion videos even at very large ( ×) temporal compression, compared to baseline MagViT-v2. Dotted boxes highlight regions where the MagViT-v2 fails catastrophically, like faces and hands, which have a lot of artifacts in the reconstructions. (right) We show that our highly compressed latent space ( ×) is suitable for training high-quality text-to-video diffusion models.",-2,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P1633.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Mahapatra_Progressive_Growing_of_Video_Tokenizers_for_Temporally_Compact_Latent_Spaces_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
