ICCV-2025-P2064,ICCV-2025-A012182,Evangelos Kazakos,shared,3,3,3,"Czech Institute of Informatics, Robotics and Cybernetics at the Czech Technical University in Prague Inria, École normale supérieure, CNRS, PSL Research University a woman is stirring something in a wok by using a spatula Figure . Output of our GROunded Video caption gEneration (GROVE) model on an instructional video. The model outputs a video-level caption (bottom) with key noun phrases in the caption coloured and localised (grounded) in the video by temporally consistent bounding boxes (top). Note how the objects are consistently annotated (with the same color) despite changes in scale and viewpoint and how the person is marked as occluded (orange box not present) in frames and when the person (or their hand) is not visible.",-5,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2064.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Kazakos_Large-scale_Pre-training_for_Grounded_Video_Caption_Generation_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
