ICCV-2025-P2243,ICCV-2025-A013236,Xingbo Yao,shared,3,6,6,"(b) 3D Reconstruction (e) Broad application scenarios Figure . Overview of MagicCity. Given satellite input, MagicCity generates (a) multi-view images with city-level consistency. (b) These images are then fed into a robust reconstruction pipeline to generate a 3D city. Our approach achieves (c) diverse style generation while maintaining (d) geometric consistency across views. (e) The proposed method has broad application scenarios, including 3D modeling assets for games, urban simulation, and more.",-4,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2243.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Yao_MagicCity_Geometry-Aware_3D_City_Generation_from_Satellite_Imagery_with_Multi-View_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
