ICCV-2025-P2269,ICCV-2025-A013401,Yi Chen,shared,3,8,8,"The University of Hong Kong, ARC Lab, Tencent PCG, The Chinese University of Hong Kong, University of California, Berkeley Next Latent Motion Token Prediction Moto-GPT . . . Pick S Text Motion Priors I have learned about: • Motion Semantics. • Trajectory Rationality. • Future Anticipation. • … Move Drawer Overall PERFORMANCE ON CALVIN Tokenized Motion Trajectory Initial Frame Act SUCCESS RATE Videos PERFORMANCE ON SIMPLER SUCCESS RATE Latent Motion Tokenizer . . . Moto w/o Motion Token Moto Figure . The overview of Moto, which utilizes Latent Motion Tokens as a bridging “language” for autoregressive pretraining on video data. The Moto-GPT pre-trained through next motion token prediction learns a wealth of motion-related prior knowledge from videos, which can be seamlessly transferred to enhance downstream robot manipulation tasks with significant performance gains.",-5,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2269.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Chen_Moto_Latent_Motion_Token_as_the_Bridging_Language_for_Learning_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
