ICCV-2025-P2371,ICCV-2025-A014050,Yuan Liu,shared,3,6,6,"School of Artificial Intelligence, Beijing Normal University School of Artificial Intelligence, Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications WATRIX.AI Addition & Disappearance Removal & Orientation Pose Substituion & Size Difference: The blue tissue packet on the right side of the school bag disappeared, and at the same time, a black charging cable appeared in the lower right corner of the image. Difference: The yellow stool in the left corner of the scene, which was previously facing the right side, is now facing the left side. The black folded umbrella that was originally at the back wall of the scene has moved to the right side of the white stool on the left. Difference: Previously, the two figures in the image had bent legs, with one leg in front and the other behind, and one arm stretched upward while the other arm pointed toward the ground. Now, both figures are standing on one leg with the other leg lifted off the ground, and their arms are tilted horizontally toward the ground. Difference: The bucket of green instant noodles in the center of the upper part of the scene has been replaced with a bucket of red instant noodles placed upside down. The bucket of red instant noodles at the far right of the upper part of the scene has been replaced with a larger bucket of blue instant noodles. Difference: A new brown rectangular mat has appeared on the floor in front of the bathtub, positioned near the middle of the scene and placed between two small stools, one blue and one pink. The rectangular pink plastic stool in the lower right corner near the tiled floor and shower area is no longer visible. Difference: A wooden board placed against the wall in front of the black bag on the left side of the corridor moves to the curved wall on the right side of the alley. There are two metal barrels placed on the right wall of the alley, and the one on the right is rotating towards the camera. Counting & Color OCR Difference: The word ""transit"" located below ""forensic"" is replaced with ""transfer"". Difference: A blue sign with the word ""Alert"" on the first row of pillars on the left side of the scene is replaced by the blue letter ""Alort"" on the left pillar at the front of the scene. Difference: In the upper left corner of the scene, the cushion on the gray stool has changed from blue to green. In the center of the scene, the number of green stools has increased from one to two. Difference: The number of lamps on the ground in front of the tent has decreased from two to one. The color of the surface on the left side of the tent has changed from gray to blue. Difference: A man wearing blue pants and a white short-sleeved shirt, who previously stood with his hands on his hips facing the dark green building on the right, has now turned to face the outdoor unit of the air conditioner on the brick house to the left. Difference: The red barrel with a yellow hazard symbol has replaced the blue barrel with the same symbol, located near the stacked boxes in front of the ladder on the right side of the scene. The air conditioning unit mounted high on the right wall between two garage doors has decreased in size. Illumination Viewpoint Difference: The lighting in the image has become darker. Difference: The scene remains the same. Difference: The scene brightness has increased. Difference: There is no difference between the two pictures. Figure . OmniDiff: a comprehensive benchmark comprising complex real-world and 3D synthetic environments, featuring distinct types of variations, with an average difference caption length of words per image pair.",-3,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2371.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Liu_OmniDiff_A_Comprehensive_Benchmark_for_Fine-grained_Image_Difference_Captioning_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
