ICCV-2025-P2399,ICCV-2025-A014222,Weihao Yu,shared,3,7,7,"The Chinese University of Hong Kong Hong Kong Baptist University University of Oxford Tencent Jarvis Lab GaussianReg (Ours) Previous SOTA Pred pose Matched! Target pose Target pose 3D information unused Figure . Comparison of GaussianReg and other methods. In contrast to previous methods that directly predict from 2D projections, our GaussianReg pioneers the incorporation of 3D information using 3D Gaussian splatting to predict pose. We present a novel ray-based registration approach that casts rays from 3D Gaussian primitives to actively search for camera poses, eliminating the need for massive training time. Experiments on the public DeepFluoro dataset [",-13,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2399.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Yu_GaussianReg_Rapid_2D3D_Registration_for_Emergency_Surgery_via_Explicit_3D_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
