ICCV-2025-P2469,ICCV-2025-A014652,Yang Liu,shared,3,10,10,"Zhejiang University of Technology Open-Vocabulary Panoptic Segmentation Apple Referring Segmentation chair, table COSINE car Few-Shot Instance Segmentation Combined Prompt Segmentation Video Object Segmentation Figure . COSINE is a unified open-world segmentation model that consolidates open-vocabulary and in-context segmentation. COSINE can simultaneously support text prompts (green boxes) and image prompts (blue boxes) as inputs to perform various segmentation tasks, including semantic segmentation, instance segmentation, panoptic segmentation, referring segmentation, and video object segmentation. In addition, COSINE can collaboratively use different types of prompts to perform various segmentation tasks.",0,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2469.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Liu_Unified_Open-World_Segmentation_with_Multi-Modal_Prompts_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
