ICCV-2025-P2602,ICCV-2025-A015451,Li-Heng Chen,shared,3,8,8,"Hong Kong University of Science and Technology Virtual Reality Application Engineering Research Center of the Ministry of Education, Beijing Normal University Input: Images Output: Camera and Mesh GCRayDiffusion timestep … … t=T t= t= Marching Cubes t= Marching Cubes Triplane-based SDF … … t=T t= Triplane-based SDF Figure . We achieve accurate pose-free neural surface learning with the aid of a novel geometric consistent ray diffusion, i.e., GCRayDiffusion, even from sparse view images (left). Our GCRayDiffusion model formulates the images’ camera poses as neural ray bundles and provides explicit sampling points generated during the denoiser processing (middle) to regularize the triplane-based SDF learning, achieving accurate surface reconstruction and camera pose estimation simultaneously (right).",-9,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2602.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Chen_GCRayDiffusion_Pose-Free_Surface_Reconstruction_via_Geometric_Consistent_Ray_Diffusion_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
