training cost. Notably, on LVIS, with × less training cost and . × inference speedup, YOLOEv8-S surpasses YOLO-Worldv2-S by . AP. When transferring to COCO, YOLOE-v8-L achieves . APb and . APm gains over closed-set YOLOv8-L with nearly × less training time. Code and models are available at here. ␀×␀␀/␀H␀V␀V␀␀ ␀L␀P␀H ␀␀␀",-7,data/raw/iccv/2025/first_pages/ICCV-2025-P2682.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2025/papers/Wang_YOLOE_Real-Time_Seeing_Anything_ICCV_2025_paper.pdf
